pub enum AgentEffect {
    ExecuteBackend { request: ExecutionRequest },
    ExecuteTool { request: ToolRequest },
    /// Requests the spawning of a child agent.
    ///
    /// NOTE (Phase 6 decision, locked): this variant is a **future data
    /// shape** reserved for core-driven spawn triggers (e.g. a future
    /// `agent.spawn` tool). It is **not** the production entry point for
    /// spawning. The sole production spawn path is `AgentSupervisor::spawn_child`
    /// (harness-runtime, Phase 6). No code currently constructs this effect,
    /// and downstream tasks (T6.1–T6.14) must not route production spawning
    /// through it; it is only interpreted by `AgentRunner::dispatch_effects`
